Numerical helper attribution
============================

Cephes-derived numerical approximations and coefficient tables occur in:
- crates/llmlip/src/mace_polar.rs: polar_mace_erfc_cephes_positive,
  polar_mace_polevl and polar_mace_p1evl.
- crates/llmlip/src/blas_backend.rs: exp_ps_avx512.

